   "body": "And the server keeps setting up heartbeats\r\n```\r\nString type = jsonDecode(message)['msg_type'];\r\n      var data = jsonDecode(message)['date'];\r\n      switch (type) {\r\n        case 'heartbeat':\r\n          var msgData = {\"Topic\": \"heartbeat\"};\r\n          _webSocket.sink.add(jsonEncode(msgData));\r\n          lastHeartbeat = 1;\r\n          break;\r\n```\r\ncheck timeout \r\n```\r\n  static localHeart() {\r\n    if (_timer != null && _timer.isActive) {\r\n      return;\r\n    }\r\n    const timeout = const Duration(seconds: 15);\r\n    _timer = Timer.periodic(timeout, (timer) {\r\n      if (loginState == 1) {\r\n        if (lastHeartbeat == 0) {\r\n          socketConnect();\r\n        } else {\r\n          lastHeartbeat = 0;\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n    });\r\n  }\r\n```",
